{"unit_id":"AirPineApplea__feiyu-chat-companion#card-zh","repo":"AirPineApplea/feiyu-chat-companion","commit":"d9bcda961f23aa87506ab678b0d3db0ad8094258","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"肥鱼陪聊是一款面向 Windows 桌面版 DSH 的桌面陪伴插件。它在桌面创建可拖动的置顶鲸鱼娘窗口，并在侧栏提供启动、显示、说话频率和回话长度等控制。桌宠会根据当前前台窗口标题主动生成简短回应，也可通过点击催她说话、右键输入问题并在气泡中收到回答；可选联动 B 站工具读取字幕评论，或联动 TTS 插件朗读。适合希望在电脑桌面获得轻量陪伴和窗口情境回应的 DSH 用户；需要 Windows 和 DSH 桌面端，其他语音或 B 站能力需相应插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:210-215","lib/index.js:621-669","overlay/pet_win32.py:403-480"]}
{"unit_id":"AirPineApplea__feiyu-chat-companion#card-en","repo":"AirPineApplea/feiyu-chat-companion","commit":"d9bcda961f23aa87506ab678b0d3db0ad8094258","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Feiyu Chat Companion is a Windows DSH desktop pet with a draggable, topmost whale character. It comments on the foreground window, responds to clicks, and answers questions in speech bubbles. Optional Bilibili tools add video context; TTS can read replies aloud. Requires Windows and DSH desktop.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:210-215","lib/index.js:621-669","overlay/pet_win32.py:403-480"]}
