{"unit_id":"AirPineApplea__feiyu-chat-companion#feature-1","repo":"AirPineApplea/feiyu-chat-companion","commit":"d9bcda961f23aa87506ab678b0d3db0ad8094258","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"肥鱼陪聊的功能「桌面置顶桌宠」：在 Windows 桌面显示可拖动的鲸鱼角色，并记住其位置。启动后宠物以置顶分层窗口显示，不抢焦点；拖动时会限制在屏幕工作区内。","source":"generated","evidence":["overlay/pet_win32.py:403-424","overlay/pet_win32.py:454-464","overlay/pet_win32.py:735-752"]}
{"unit_id":"AirPineApplea__feiyu-chat-companion#feature-2","repo":"AirPineApplea/feiyu-chat-companion","commit":"d9bcda961f23aa87506ab678b0d3db0ad8094258","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"肥鱼陪聊的功能「根据当前窗口主动回应」：桌宠周期读取前台窗口标题；当用户在同一窗口停留且达到配置的等待和冷却条件时，会通过自己的短会话生成简短气泡回应。","source":"generated","evidence":["overlay/pet_win32.py:642-680","lib/index.js:835-878","lib/index.js:936-1005"]}
{"unit_id":"AirPineApplea__feiyu-chat-companion#feature-3","repo":"AirPineApplea/feiyu-chat-companion","commit":"d9bcda961f23aa87506ab678b0d3db0ad8094258","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"肥鱼陪聊的功能「点击催说」：用户短按并点击桌宠时，桌宠执行弹跳反馈并向 Host 发出 poke 事件，随后由会话生成一句回应。","source":"generated","evidence":["overlay/pet_win32.py:748-763","lib/index.js:543-619"]}
{"unit_id":"AirPineApplea__feiyu-chat-companion#feature-4","repo":"AirPineApplea/feiyu-chat-companion","commit":"d9bcda961f23aa87506ab678b0d3db0ad8094258","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"肥鱼陪聊的功能「桌宠问答」：从桌宠右键菜单打开输入框提交问题；Host 将问题发送给专用短会话，并把回答显示在气泡里，超时或失败时也会显示提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["overlay/pet_win32.py:860-875","lib/index.js:621-669","lib/index.js:702-738"]}
{"unit_id":"AirPineApplea__feiyu-chat-companion#feature-5","repo":"AirPineApplea/feiyu-chat-companion","commit":"d9bcda961f23aa87506ab678b0d3db0ad8094258","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"肥鱼陪聊的功能「说话气泡与工具调用」：面板可控制宠物进程，其他 agent 也可调用 pet_say 工具让桌宠显示指定短句；气泡按时长显示，网页端还可选择通过兼容的 TTS 插件朗读。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1052-1087","lib/index.js:1089-1205","lib/client.js:51-108"]}
